WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:03.209 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
Before you choose The Watcher, this

00:00:03.209 --> 00:00:05.050 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
is how its cycle works.

00:00:05.050 --> 00:00:07.995 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
This video previews the membership; watching it does

00:00:07.995 --> 00:00:11.308 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
not start a trial, complete checkout or grant access.

00:00:11.308 --> 00:00:14.621 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
Review the current terms on Whop before you subscribe.

00:00:14.621 --> 00:00:17.198 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
The monthly choice begins with seven days

00:00:17.198 --> 00:00:20.144 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
free and then costs twenty-eight dollars every twenty-eight

00:00:20.144 --> 00:00:22.721 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
days, unless you cancel under Whop's terms.

00:00:22.721 --> 00:00:24.929 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
An annual choice is listed separately.

00:00:24.929 --> 00:00:28.611 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
Each cycle follows one being through four weekly chapters, making

00:00:28.611 --> 00:00:32.292 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
room for the image and its story to unfold slowly.

00:00:32.292 --> 00:00:34.869 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
In the first week, the Realm brings

00:00:34.869 --> 00:00:37.446 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
you face to face with that being.

00:00:37.446 --> 00:00:40.760 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
The point is not to watch everything at once.

00:00:40.760 --> 00:00:43.705 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
It is to return to one vision, and

00:00:43.705 --> 00:00:46.650 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
to see more when the next part arrives.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:53.766 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
Week two is the Process.

00:00:53.766 --> 00:00:56.591 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
Here the focus moves behind the finished image,

00:00:56.591 --> 00:00:59.416 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
toward the decisions and craft that shaped it.

00:00:59.416 --> 00:01:02.595 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
In week three, the Records open up its story.

00:01:02.595 --> 00:01:04.714 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
Names, context and details give the

00:01:04.714 --> 00:01:07.186 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
vision a place in a wider mythology.

00:01:07.186 --> 00:01:09.658 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
Week four brings the Session, the time

00:01:09.658 --> 00:01:12.130 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
set aside for a live gathering, questions

00:01:12.130 --> 00:01:14.602 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
and the next turn of the cycle.

00:01:14.602 --> 00:01:17.427 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
Check the actual schedule and availability in Whop

00:01:17.427 --> 00:01:20.606 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
rather than assuming a browser page is a ticket.

00:01:20.606 --> 00:01:23.784 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
The film then moves through the archive: images, files

00:01:23.784 --> 00:01:26.963 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
and material intended to make the work worth revisiting.

00:01:26.963 --> 00:01:29.788 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
The exact items you can open depend on

00:01:29.788 --> 00:01:32.260 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
the membership and your verified Whop access.

00:01:32.260 --> 00:01:35.792 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
Think of this as a look at the room, not

00:01:35.792 --> 00:01:38.970 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
as confirmation that your account already owns its contents.

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:52.736 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
The community spaces make room to talk about

00:01:52.736 --> 00:01:55.130 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
the work and to return between chapters.

00:01:55.130 --> 00:01:57.865 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
The Codex, if offered, is a separate product;

00:01:57.865 --> 00:02:00.601 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
it is not automatically included in The Watcher.

00:02:00.601 --> 00:02:03.337 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
Likewise, other future books or editions should not

00:02:03.337 --> 00:02:05.731 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
be assumed to come with this membership.

00:02:05.731 --> 00:02:08.124 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
You can compare the monthly trial with

00:02:08.124 --> 00:02:10.518 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
the separate annual option before you decide.

00:02:10.518 --> 00:02:12.570 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
The monthly trial is seven days

00:02:12.570 --> 00:02:14.964 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
free, then twenty-eight dollars every twenty-eight days.

00:02:14.964 --> 00:02:18.383 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
The seven-night return window described on this site begins after

00:02:18.383 --> 00:02:21.461 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
the first payment, not when the free trial begins.

00:02:21.461 --> 00:02:24.197 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
For the live price, eligibility, renewal terms and

00:02:24.197 --> 00:02:27.275 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
your actual entitlement, rely on Whop and its receipt.

00:02:27.275 --> 00:02:29.668 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
If you are ready, use the choice

00:02:29.668 --> 00:02:32.062 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
below this film to continue to Whop.

00:02:32.062 --> 00:02:35.140 line:18% position:50% size:84% align:center
You can leave this preview without beginning a trial.
